and the reproducibility exporter.

The objective is:

ONE EXPERIMENT ID.

ONE EVIDENCE MODEL.

ONE SET OF VERSIONED DEFINITIONS.

MULTIPLE AGENTS AND APPLICATIONS.

NO SILENT SEMANTIC DRIFT.

==================================================
CORE DATA PRINCIPLE
==================================================

Every material object should answer:

WHAT IS THIS?

WHICH EXPERIMENT DOES IT BELONG TO?

WHO OR WHAT CREATED IT?

WHEN WAS IT CREATED?

WHICH SOFTWARE VERSION CREATED IT?

WHAT EVIDENCE SUPPORTS IT?

HAS IT CHANGED?

WHAT IS ITS HASH?

